title: Leadership changes

@add_brandler
title: Bring in Heinrich Brandler
subtitle: Right faction · dev: brandler_advisor = 1, n_advisors +1, kf_right_strength +4
tags: kpd_add_advisor
view-if: brandler_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3
on-arrival: brandler_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1; kf_right_strength += 4
go-to: root

Heinrich Brandler joins the leadership as an adviser. Right is strengthened.

