@remove_brandler
title: Remove Heinrich Brandler
subtitle: Right faction · dev: brandler_advisor = 0, n_advisors −1, kf_right_dissent +5
tags: kpd_remove_advisor
view-if: brandler_advisor = 1
on-arrival: brandler_advisor = 0; n_advisors -= 1; kf_right_dissent += 5
go-to: root

Heinrich Brandler is removed from the leadership. Right regards it as a purge, and its dissent rises.

